    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gassal Simulator</strong> is a unique simulation game that allows players to experience the traditional <strong>ghusl (Islamic funeral washing) process</strong>. In this game, you take on the role of a <strong>gassal</strong>, performing the ritual washing, shrouding, and preparation for burial in accordance with Islamic traditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Simulation Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Every stage of the ghusl process is carefully designed to provide an <strong>authentic</strong> and immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Drive through the city, visiting funeral tents to collect the deceased with your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Environment Design</strong> \u2013 Realistic graphics and meticulously designed locations create an immersive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Scenarios and Missions</strong> \u2013 Players can experience different aspects of the profession through diverse missions and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and Engaging Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 The game's calm and respectful tone offers a peaceful gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cemetery Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Includes burial procedures and transportation mechanics for a complete funeral simulation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gassal Simulator</strong> provides a <strong>culturally immersive and educational</strong> experience, helping players gain insight into an important tradition. If you enjoy <strong>realistic simulation games with meaningful themes</strong>, this game is perfect for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gassal Simulator</strong> is a unique simulation game that allows players to experience the traditional <strong>ghusl (Islamic funeral washing) process</strong>. In this game, you take on the role of a <strong>gassal</strong>, performing the ritual washing, shrouding, and preparation for burial in accordance with Islamic traditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Simulation Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Every stage of the ghusl process is carefully designed to provide an <strong>authentic</strong> and immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Drive through the city, visiting funeral tents to collect the deceased with your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Environment Design</strong> \u2013 Realistic graphics and meticulously designed locations create an immersive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Scenarios and Missions</strong> \u2013 Players can experience different aspects of the profession through diverse missions and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and Engaging Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 The game's calm and respectful tone offers a peaceful gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cemetery Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Includes burial procedures and transportation mechanics for a complete funeral simulation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gassal Simulator</strong> provides a <strong>culturally immersive and educational</strong> experience, helping players gain insight into an important tradition. If you enjoy <strong>realistic simulation games with meaningful themes</strong>, this game is perfect for you!</p>",
